RIM Labels and Control Flow Example
RIM Demonstrates GOTA and COLL commands

ECKO Starting program...
SEP counter = 0

:start
ECKO In start label
COLL subroutine
ECKO Back from subroutine

RIM Check if we should loop
SEP counter = 1
IZ %counter% == 0 GOTA start

ECKO Continuing after loop...
GOTA end

:subroutine
ECKO Inside subroutine
ECKO This was called with COLL
ECKO Subroutine complete

:end
ECKO Program finished!
EXIS 0
